  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can swoop and soar on avian wings.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Tengu Wings<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your fly speed when using your Tengu Wings increases by 10 feet, plus 10 feet per 3 mythic tiers you possess. You can use these wings for a total number of minutes per day equal to your character level plus your mythic tier. This duration need not be continuous but must be used in 1-minute increments.</p>\n<p>You can increase the duration to a number of hours equal to your character level plus your mythic tier; however, your speed is halved and your maneuverability is reduced to poor. You can resume your normal speed and maneuverability at any time, but doing so immediately ends that hour of the effect’s duration and begins a new minute of its normal duration.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
